		{
			description: ["You have successfully done what most people in the 21st century achieved, you are only 300 years behind all of mankind! Now that you have passed your basic training, its time to fully leave Earth's planetary bounds. Mars is your next destination and major test. EX-Port requires employees to master the elements of all planets before the next can be reached. You will need to pressurize the basic energies of Earth together to form a Core, this will allow you to mass produce the planet's resources and achieve your flight to Mars."]
